    "skyPreset": "golden_alpine_meadow",
    "loreSummary": "Three things come off the head and all three walk out the same way: grain off the silt the river lays down behind the estuary, grazing and greens off the shell-grass behind the raised beach, and ore broken out of the cave country inland. It is the last settled ground on the western road, so everything it makes goes back through the junction and two more villages before it reaches the coast the ships use."
  },
